// BT-3913: a field write made in an enclosing actor loop body survives a nested
// `do:separatedBy:`. Each inner pass adds 1 + 10 + 2 = 13 to `t`; the 2 x 2
// passes add 1 to `n` each. The field write makes the enclosing loops
// `StateAcc` frames, so this pins the answer for that shape, not the cell
// seed itself: `separated_by_in_actor_loop_nest_seeds_from_the_cell`
// (codegen tests, `guarded_op_loops.rs`) pins the `TakeSeed` emission.
// See fixtures/bt3913nested_seed_actor.bt.

TestCase subclass: Bt3913NestedSeedTest

  testFieldWriteSurvivesTheNestedSeed =>
    self assert: Bt3913NestedSeedActor spawn run equals: #[52, 4]
